    "",
    "  rich_event      6.4  an event on top of a stable identity. Archetype must",
    "                       NOT change: consecutive_windows_supporting_change is",
    "                       1 and rule 11 needs 2. The spike must come out as",
    "                       effects, decorations, activity and lighting instead",
    "                       (rule 13, temporal_mix.moment 0.62).",
    "  sparse_previous 6.5  data_sufficiency low with a previous plan. Reproduce",
    "                       it, change_magnitude none, confidence about 35.",
    "  empty_no_plan   6.6  no posts, no previous plan. Zoning default, density",
    "                       at most 2, mood serene, no effects, confidence 20.",
    "",
    "Each block is a complete PlanningInput except `taxonomy`, which the runner",
    "injects at call time from the live taxonomy so these files never go stale",
    "against the asset library. docs/03 section 2.3.",
    "",
    "Use them to check a prompt edit without spending a run over the whole city."
